1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,620
(Bernadette:)Okay, movie night--
what do you want to watch?

2
00:00:02,622 --> 00:00:04,492
(Amy:)Whatever happened
to that ape movie you were in?

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:05,690
(Penny:)Oh, God.

4
00:00:05,692 --> 00:00:06,662
(Penny:)Probably nothing.

5
00:00:06,659 --> 00:00:08,789
(Penny:)I think I saw the director
twirling a sign

6
00:00:08,795 --> 00:00:10,665
(Penny:)outside the Verizon store.

7
00:00:10,663 --> 00:00:12,163
(Bernadette:)Search for it.

8
00:00:12,165 --> 00:00:13,165
PENNY:
Wha... no.

9
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:14,166
No! Why?

10
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:15,497
'Cause it would be
fun to watch.

11
00:00:15,501 --> 00:00:17,001
(Penny:)It would be humiliating.

12
00:00:17,003 --> 00:00:19,533
(Bernadette:)Well, now we have
two reasons.

13
00:00:21,441 --> 00:00:22,441
(Amy:)They have it.

14
00:00:22,442 --> 00:00:23,442
(Bernadette:)Please,
can we watch it?

15
00:00:23,443 --> 00:00:24,643
(sighs)
Please?

16
00:00:24,644 --> 00:00:26,874
(Penny:)Fine, but I'm telling you--
it's terrible.

17
00:00:26,879 --> 00:00:29,379
(Amy:)Have you even seen it?
No.

18
00:00:29,382 --> 00:00:30,682
(Bernadette:)Well, maybe it turned out
better than you think.

19
00:00:30,683 --> 00:00:31,983
(bike bell rings on TV)

20
00:00:31,984 --> 00:00:33,884
MAN: Bananas,
get your fresh bananas.

21
00:00:34,654 --> 00:00:36,684
(laughing):
It really didn't.

22
00:00:41,694 --> 00:00:45,294
(Leonard:)Sheldon, this is
superfluid helium.

23
00:00:45,298 --> 00:00:46,698
(Leonard:)Put this in
your mouth,

24
00:00:46,699 --> 00:00:48,369
(Leonard:)your tongue will
freeze and break off.

25
00:00:50,169 --> 00:00:52,999
(Sheldon:)Does it smell like blueberries?

26
00:00:53,005 --> 00:00:54,005
(Leonard:)No.

27
00:00:54,006 --> 00:00:56,076
(Sheldon:)Then we're probably okay.

28
00:00:56,075 --> 00:00:58,145
(Howard:)Hey, your paper
got mentioned

29
00:00:58,144 --> 00:00:59,714
on the Quantum Diaries
physics blog.

30
00:00:59,712 --> 00:01:00,682
(gasps)
Really?

